flowchart TD
    Register[Existing finite root PLACE / ObjectiveService registration] --> Authority[Actual kind owner state / ObjectiveService]
    Authority --> Settle[Existing settle / Rear state_changed / GameSession]
    Settle --> Dirty[Preview coalesced field dirty / fresh on visible return]
    Dirty --> Policy[ONE current permitted Policy result]
    Authority --> Scalars[Existing ownership label and colour / proposed kind and state scalars]
    Scalars --> Policy
    Policy --> Filter[PLACE AND actual registered Resource / Route Hub / Observation]
    Filter --> Anchors[Scene-owned actual-ID ground anchors / current terrain Y]
    Anchors --> Views[Cached title ownership colour and state / update retained anchors too]
    Views --> Cues[Fixed screen symbol and readable owner/state labels]
    Camera[Existing camera view viewport invalidations] --> Projection[Cached point / shared finite front and viewport visibility]
    Projection --> Cues
    Cues --> Pick[Existing strict18px / current row tie order / current Policy-ID inspection]
    Policy -->|HQ or order-only places| Legacy[Existing unsupported PLACE proxies unchanged]
    Policy -->|PERSON T01 and CONTACT| Existing[Current person truck and report-only presentation unchanged]
    Replace[World/session replacement or membership removal] --> Release[Disconnect old bindings / release World and cue refs before free]
    Release --> Anchors
    Initial[Proposed ONE untouched neutral resource-centre-blue / size500 image] --> Pick
    Open[Actual ownership transition runtime acceptance OPEN / no fake state or capture replay] -.-> Views
